# e2e fixture for the graph layer

Deterministic content for `tests/e2e/graph.test.ts`. Two tasks form a
parent-child edge; two more share the same `@id` so the dup-id
diagnostic + canonical-winner rule can be exercised end-to-end. Don't
edit the ids or line ordering — the test suite pins specific values.

- [ ] dup occurrence A <!-- @id:e2e-dup -->
- [x] dup occurrence B <!-- @id:e2e-dup -->
- [ ] parent task <!-- @id:e2e-graph-parent -->
- [ ] child task <!-- @id:e2e-graph-child @parent:e2e-graph-parent -->
